epare the image before reading the mark, but read it before writing anything","Make `delivery_store` check the mark implicitly as part of a placement write"],"default_guess":"Declare that `photo_delivery` knows A6 rule 5 and reads the mark immediately after the absent-placement check, before the named-file check or any image write.","witness":{"initial":"A project has no placement, has a damaged mark record for the requested source id, and the requested source name is absent.","events":["The caller requests delivery with a valid project id and source id.","The operation acquires the project lock and finds no placement.","The implementation must choose whether to inspect the damaged mark before or after judging the named file."],"outcomes":["Checking the mark first returns M08 `state_unavailable`.","Checking the named file first returns M06 `failed` with `not_ready_or_absent`."],"observer":"The caller sees a different response type and failure code."}}]}
